edit_file("front-end/verification-reports/feature-verification.md",
          "Create feature verification report",
          "# Implementation Verification: Feature Name\n\n## Component Verification\n\n| Component | Structure | Props | Testing | Accessibility | Performance |\n|-----------|----------|-------|---------|--------------|------------|\n| ComponentA | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| ComponentB | ✅ | ✅ | ⚠️ | ✅ | ⚠️ |\n| ComponentC | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ⚠️ | ❌ |\n\n## Hook Verification\n\n| Hook | Implementation | Testing | Performance |\n|------|----------------|---------|------------|\n| useFeatureA | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |\n| useFeatureB | ✅ | ⚠️ | ✅ |\n\n## State Management Verification\n\n| Aspect | Implementation | Testing |\n|--------|----------------|--------|\n| Slice Definition | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Reducers | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Selectors | ⚠️ | ❌ |\n| Async Actions | ✅ | ⚠️ |\n\n## UI/UX Verification\n\n| Aspect | Status | Notes |\n|--------|--------|-------|\n| Responsive Design | ✅ | Verified on mobile, tablet, and desktop |\n| Accessibility | ⚠️ | Missing some aria-labels |\n| Loading States | ✅ | Proper skeletons implemented |\n| Error States | ⚠️ | Some error handling missing |\n\n## Requirements Coverage\n\n| Requirement | Status | Notes |\n|------------|--------|-------|\n| Feature A | ✅ | Fully implemented |\n| Feature B | ⚠️ | Implemented but needs refinement |\n| Feature C | ❌ | Not implemented |\n\n## Issues and Recommendations\n\n1. Add missing tests for ComponentC\n2. Improve performance in ComponentB and ComponentC\n3. Add missing selectors for derived state\n4. Add selector tests\n5. Fix accessibility issues in ComponentC\n6. Implement error handling for API calls\n\n## Verification Status\n\nPartial Pass - Needs fixes for testing and performance issues before deployment")
```

## Example Verification Response

### Complete Implementation Verification

```
💻 1000xdev [front-end-workflow]

Implementation verification complete for Feature Name.

Component verification:
- All 5 components implemented completely
- All components have proper prop interfaces
- All components have tests with >80% coverage
- All components follow accessibility guidelines
- 4/5 components have proper performance optimizations

Hook verification:
- All custom hooks implemented correctly
- All hooks have proper typing
- All hooks have tests with >90% coverage
- All hooks follow dependency array best practices

State management verification:
- Redux slice properly implemented
- All reducers follow immutability patterns
- All selectors are memoized
- Async thunks have proper loading/error states
- All state management code has tests

UI/UX verification:
- All screens are fully responsive
- Loading states implemented for async operations
- Error states handle API failures gracefully
- All interactive elements are keyboard accessible

Requirements coverage:
- 12/12 requirements fully implemented
- All acceptance criteria met
- No missing components identified

Minor issues identified:
- ComponentB could benefit from additional memoization
- Some selectors could use more comprehensive tests

Verification successful. Implementation is complete and ready for deployment.
```

### Incomplete Implementation Verification

```
💻 1000xdev [front-end-workflow]

Implementation verification complete for Feature Name.

Component verification:
- 4/5 components fully implemented
- 3/5 components have complete tests
- 2/5 components have accessibility issues
- 3/5 components need performance optimization

Hook verification:
- All hooks implemented but useFeatureC has dependency array issues
- 2/3 hooks have proper test coverage
- useFeatureA missing cleanup function

State management verification:
- Redux slice implemented but has some direct mutations
- 4/6 reducers have proper tests
- Selectors missing memoization
- Async error handling incomplete

UI/UX verification:
- Responsive design incomplete on profile view
- Loading states missing for 2 components
- Error states need improvement
- 3 accessibility issues found

Requirements coverage:
- 9/12 requirements fully implemented
- 2/12 requirements partially implemented
- 1/12 requirements not implemented

Implementation recommendations:
- Complete ProfileComponent implementation
- Add missing tests for HookB and reducers
- Fix direct state mutations in userSlice.ts
- Implement memoized selectors
- Address accessibility issues in Form components
- Add loading states to DataTable and UserProfile
- Implement proper error handling for async operations

Verification revealed issues that need to be addressed before deployment.
```

This verification process ensures that front-end implementations are complete, meet all requirements, follow best practices, and are ready for deployment. It focuses on component structure, state management, hooks, testing, accessibility, and performance to provide a comprehensive assessment of implementation quality. 